      "sourceEvidence": "Moorfield community choir is inviting adults who are unsure about singing in a group to a Wednesday taster on 25 November. There are no auditions and no requirement to read music. The first twenty minutes are a shared warm-up; newcomers may listen before joining in. The session begins at 19:00, but someone arriving from work may enter quietly until 19:20. A first taster is free; the ordinary weekly contribution applies from the second visit.",
